2. What is the total amount of meat Prince sells in $n$ days?
\begin{align*} \text{Meat sold per day} &= 150 \text{ kg} \\ \text{Number of days} &= n \\ \text{Total meat sold in } n \text{ days} &= 150 \text{ kg/day} \times n \text{ days} \\ &= 150n \text{ kg}\end{align*}
3. How many days will it take Prince to sell the meat from Bill's bull?
\begin{align*} \text{Weight of the bull} &= 750 \text{ kg} \\ \text{Total meat sold in } n \text{ days} &= 150n \text{ kg} \\ \text{To sell the meat from the bull, we need} &= 150n = 750 \\ n &= \frac{750}{150} \\ n &= 5\end{aligned}
It will take Prince 5 days to sell the meat from Bill's bull.

